File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2462
Function: libxml_parent
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and used (cur->type) without verifying it is non-NULL. If PyxmlNode_Get returns NULL due to an invalid argument, this results in a NULL pointer dereference.

